{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：17:05 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n\n<p>TVB視帝陳展鵬近年吸金力強勁，早前與太太單文柔（Phoebe）及女兒「小豬比」進駐複式獨立屋，由昔日的分層單位升級住大屋！近日YouTube頻道《爆廠》公開了陳氏一家三口的家庭Vlog，令這間新居的更多角落曝光。從片段可見，大屋採用現代簡約的米白色配搭木系色調，採光度極高，客廳樓底開揚闊落，旁邊設有內置樓梯直通上層，整體設計兼具空間感與溫馨感。</p>\n<h2>單文柔與女兒為陳展鵬洗車變濕身大戰</h2>\n<p>除室內環境寬敞外，屋外同樣空間感十足。這集Vlog以單文柔與小豬比挑戰為陳展鵬洗車為主題，兩母女越幫越忙變成全身濕透的玩水大戰，場面搞笑又溫馨。片中亦見屋外附設私人花園及庭院，有足夠空間讓女兒嬉戲放電之餘，更有眼利網民發現門外空地停泊了至少兩部座駕，戶外空間極之充裕。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬一家三口在客廳梳化上，盡享天倫之樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2d3189417a4288f2f62c175aa990751/2026-09/1_12_59.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔與小豬比坐在樓梯上，準備接受特別任務。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00d203a23092565c02af59fb38fc79a6/2026-09/2_2_80.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔問小豬比之前有無試過洗車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88ffabe5000fc31c1421a2b90db1d621/2026-09/3_51.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比化身小師傅，向媽媽講解洗車步驟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/805cdd051aa71fc69b34bd3a117c5d7f/2026-09/4_5_54.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔請教女兒應該如何開始洗車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd6a86d1c3bb3240ae64eda587252af2/2026-09/5_5_49.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比將洗車液倒入水桶，準備工作有板有眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/676e241a48b53e58b8d527de5e8eebd0/2026-09/6_1_38.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔與小豬比母女檔拍住上，準備好工具開始洗車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/962fb62e67c8dd4419c8d4ea79ce1ff1/2026-09/7_15_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比手持水喉，宣佈正式開始洗車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a565005965716a9e85abb1e19453cce0/2026-09/8_1_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔指導女兒由車頂開始噴水。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb74eab280c50bb82d34d05766412946/2026-09/9_1_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比被媽媽抱起，興奮地向車身射水。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/362c8f8225b0579bbd318b0c54e83feb/2026-09/10_0_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比自信滿滿地表示：「我識㗎！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84275474e8e61192b8de6c6cfb04e359/2026-09/11_0_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔在旁指導，小豬比有模有樣地向車頭噴水。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d496096f350021e5c762349859866a3/2026-09/12_19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"獨立屋停車位泊了兩部座駕，空間非常闊落。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d86884bbfffdc8e8000f7cb70ddc9c4/2026-09/13_0_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔偷偷走到一旁，準備給女兒「驚喜」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/675f7447229a94a26d8f7f2447888bb4/2026-09/14_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔走入屋外的小徑，回眸一笑，似乎已準備好「反擊」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1508fc11e7193e984504409d9ed9364a/2026-09/15_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔手持水喉笑言：「我已經有備而來。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/242ed2cea9ed653765863375a0b76241/2026-09/16_0_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比專注地用水喉沖洗車輪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1db424e35d4db93d9163054d4b9dd3dc/2026-09/17_0_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩母女互相射水，小豬比的頭髮沾滿泡沫，場面搞笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c9ca6accd6cca4006c2042cfa34c592/2026-09/18_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔從後協助，小豬比落力地用海綿擦洗車身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c71c2241949dfc4921dc0f5e37a2bb15/2026-09/19_0_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩母女合力擦洗車頂，非常合拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6f69be3b19a1f91e8522d17558292db/2026-09/20_0_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比負責沖水，媽媽負責抹車，分工合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c74f53a1749a15bfa9d47b2a77df701a/2026-09/21_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一講爸爸，陳展鵬就剛好回到家中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/551d78532364a6dcace0320173be957f/2026-09/22_0_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬看到座駕被洗得乾乾淨淨，一臉驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/926990cda9cb1c9cd0979ada8bc0ae99/2026-09/23_0_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬出動「神救援」，與女兒合力抹乾車身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f12636bddcd8584dbc248eacc2b912c/2026-09/24_0_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬輕鬆抱起小豬比，讓她可以抹到車頂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8aeb76ddaa9a99b53038f8e34b0a2a49/2026-09/25_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比化身「人肉」毛巾，在爸爸幫助下趴在車頂抹車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f518e94aeff81c414a41ac86fe591a84/2026-09/26_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比在車頂爬行，玩得不亦樂乎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90c5e04892fdec02ec12f8cca71ed5dd/2026-09/27_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比騎在爸爸膊馬上，溫馨互動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6fdc590f5b9f184fa8b6b98e6d55dc9/2026-09/28_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比坐在爸爸膊頭上，非常威風。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5cd2baade9520689fa05270bfd0612aa/2026-09/29_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家三口樂也融融，小豬比騎膊馬最開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53c2d28653cfc1d063c0a03287ee00ce/2026-09/30_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬孭著女兒，與太太在屋外散步。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03c50c2b0548f9aecddfdd619e6e99fc/2026-09/31_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬給予女兒99.9分的高度評價。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65b29fa018255c124fdfc3a6be818df2/2026-09/32_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任務完成！陳展鵬孭著小豬比，一家人開心回家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa5fa18571c2d06b78c15de4292cacf1/2026-09/33_4.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳展鵬打造理想家居親力親為</h2>\n<p>對於新居曝光被指「越住越豪」，陳展鵬早前接受訪問時曾親自解畫，透露新居並非刻意炫耀奢華，而是全家人共同建立的溫暖小竇，他幽默澄清：「其實係『豪』，係『自豪』個『豪』，唔係『富豪』個『豪』。」單文柔亦夫唱婦隨，力撐老公事事親力親為，大爆背後的心血：「點解咁自豪，因為所有嘢係佢一手一腳做，包括木工、水電、拆嘢、搬嘢，全部都係佢做同埋策劃。」兩公婆齊心合力打造理想家居，幸福感滿瀉！</p>\n<h2>即睇陳展鵬新居內部更多空間：</h2>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔早前帶同囡囡搬到複式獨立屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92c015b4782c35a4b8817c5e980b94dd/2024-04/Screenshot_20240421_192920_com_instagram_android.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬坐在樓梯間。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f3e8ade9e365e44528aab8f300a0299/2026-05/raco_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樓梯旁的櫃上擺放咖啡機及用具，可見陳展鵬的生活品味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25e51fefe2a53f806241cf6dd256a184/2026-05/raco_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔多度在IG分享豪宅照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/497264271b461992c809882646d8cd44/2026-05/raco_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的太太單文柔近日曝光女兒的睡房。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e0180c1c21274c169ea3fa564a80e36/2026-06/RUCO_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔公開女兒的睡房，見到布置簡潔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1fc89eecab9ce5f116a4b7576f78169e/2026-06/RUCO_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬囡囡的房間只有一張書枱及凳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/016d81b0afe93fd97a860eb88e26d4ea/2026-06/RUCO_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬囡囡小豬比的睡床只有一個咕臣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15e6035c0143b492db33ecbcd50c9cfd/2026-06/RUCO_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬日前在IG分享影片，帶女兒小豬比出海玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e91921b5f2a417739dd5cb6df90b9cf/2026-06/RUCO_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬女兒小豬比站在直立板上，平衡感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7adac211352f349b7087c8fa84d36648/2026-06/RUCO_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬囡囡小豬比左右划水，動作流暢，玩得非常開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7eac26c32deb744de96bd456a4b5809d/2026-06/RUCO_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬親手打造愛巢，包括木工、水電、拆卸、搬運到組裝傢俬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87edd17c32f12dc5b87bacb79e67309c/2026-04/VS----2_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬將舊魚池改造成植物區。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53246068df10bc2a76cbe8543c92e6b5/2026-04/VS----2_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬親自當上花王，打理植物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/974368640e5c2b0486c7aa989e52e543/2026-04/VS----2_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"窗外種有大樹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53ecdba42e2b85e5a5fafe9880780e17/2026-04/VS----2_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大花園特別為女兒設計，可以玩餐飽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd59ed3e852e02ba4468ec298fe05935/2026-04/VS----0_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔示範用智能門鎖。非常方便。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d880285c5705a7a61cacf1861887b712/2026-03/VS--1Instagram-0_05__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔表示家門外，有24小時智能監控。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b191b31e62f60cf8b6366c94a4f1b93e/2026-03/VS--1Instagram-0_17__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬承認搬新居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47c5ad25182087550e27ef373e6a6da7/2026-04/VS----0_15__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的複式單位，樓底甚高，寬敞舒適。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/001ac557bf0dbaa57034220cb67b152f/2026-04/VS----0_01__3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單位採光度甚佳，充滿暖暖的自然光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/982f9aec78ad5fee1a026bae64654d4c/2026-04/VS----0_03__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"室內的每件小擺設，也充滿幸福感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35d69ca5004f2ccc382b6b90bf3111d2/2026-04/VS----0_09__3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的複式單位，有著巨型落地玻璃窗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/187e2c7da097de0e2ade2b73dc0a4a2f/2026-04/VS----0_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳寬敞舒適，空間感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b9755fe188a62e849b21c376ab82a82/2026-04/VS----0_41_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全屋以白色為主，連小家電也要襯色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fd69b61c2510f8f9c0605ce3a869f74/2026-04/VS----0_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"落地玻璃可看到室外的植物區，而且採光度十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95cc9464d6cf9de50efc604adbeb398f/2026-04/VS----0_53_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬透露曾為傢俬的尺寸，跟老婆單文柔有小磨擦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d077411b4f448a4d91bdcd23950ccf76/2026-04/VS----2_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"室內裝潢簡潔舒適。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e911614fe2fcb23c2236cdc4cafee14e/2026-04/VS----1_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的複式單位，以純白及淺木色為主調。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da841e950b507db55ccdf33c5cd1147b/2026-04/VS----1_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔為老公在家中設置一個獎項陳列櫃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2602af792141c2eb1e7ba5806f68cb67/2026-04/VS----4_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔新居廚房，寬敞整潔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb8915087252ae02b68058f2e0d7b86d/2026-03/VS--1Instagram-0_51_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T09:20:10.784639+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":572,"images":64,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}